        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Loneliness</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 710px;\n    padding: 2px 5px 8px 14px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 420px 91px;\n    column-gap: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .main {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 18.1px;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n  .main p {\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .section {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    margin-top: 1px;\n  }\n  .mark-yellow {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 24%, #f5d99a 24%, #f5d99a 91%, transparent 91%);\n  }\n  .glossary {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 18.2px;\n    padding-top: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .entry { margin: 0 0 5px 0; }\n  .term {\n    display: inline;\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 18%, #f4d997 18%, #f4d997 94%, transparent 94%);\n  }\n  .green {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 17%, #b8dfb0 17%, #b8dfb0 94%, transparent 94%);\n  }\n  .blue {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 17%, #bbe7e8 17%, #bbe7e8 94%, transparent 94%);\n  }\n  .pink {\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 17%, #efbcbc 17%, #efbcbc 94%, transparent 94%);\n  }\n  .indent { padding-left: 8px; }\n  .small-gap { margin-top: 2px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"main\">\n    <p>Ask yourself what loneliness means to you.</p>\n    <p>问问自己孤独对你意味着什么。</p>\n\n    <p>If you're telling yourself that loneliness is a terrible thing, that</p>\n    <p>it's dangerous to be alone, and that you can't fend for yourself in</p>\n    <p>life, you have a problem.</p>\n    <p>如果你告诉自己孤独是一件可怕的事情，孤独是危险的，你不</p>\n    <p>能在生活中照顾自己，你就有问题了。</p>\n\n    <p>Therefore, you must change these irrational ideas for more</p>\n    <p><span class=\"mark-yellow\">rational</span> and realistic ones.</p>\n    <p>所以，你一定要把这些非理性的想法，换成<span class=\"mark-yellow\">更理性</span>、更现实的</p>\n    <p>想法。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"section\">Spend time with you</p>\n    <p>与您共度时光</p>\n    <p>Force yourself to spend time alone.</p>\n    <p>强迫自己独处。</p>\n\n    <p>In order to change, you must not only act on a <span class=\"mark-yellow\">mental</span> or</p>\n    <p>cognitive level, but also on a behavioral level.</p>\n    <p>为了改变，你不仅要有精神或认知层面上的意识，还要在行为</p>\n    <p>层面上行动。</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"mark-yellow\">Program</span> <span class=\"mark-yellow\">entire</span> weekends alone with your own company.</p>\n    <p>计划<span class=\"mark-yellow\">整个</span>周末单独由自己陪着自己。</p>\n\n    <p>Enjoy a book or a movie if you want but avoid social media.</p>\n    <p>如果你愿意，享受一本书或一部电影，但避免社交媒体。</p>\n    <p>Go to the movies, to the beach, to the mountains, alone.</p>\n    <p>去看电影，去海滩，去山上，一个人。</p>\n    <p>Take a trip without any company.</p>\n    <p>在没有任何陪伴的情况下进行一次旅行。</p>\n\n    <p>When you do this for long enough, you'll realize that you</p>\n    <p>survived, that your fears weren't real, and that you've met</p>\n    <p>your own true self and now you know yourself better.</p>\n    <p>当你这样做足够长的时间后，你会意识到你幸存了下来，你的</p>\n    <p>恐惧不是真的，你已经遇到了真正的自己，现在你更了解自己</p>\n    <p>了。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"section\">Connect with others</p>\n    <p>与他人联系</p>\n    <p>Manage your time so you surround yourself with people.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"glossary\">\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"term\">rational</span>: adj.<br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">【人】有理</span><br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">性的，理智</span><br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">的;能作出理</span><br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">智决定的，</span><br>\n      <span class=\"indent\">理性的</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"term\">mental</span>: adj. 精<br>\n      神状态的<br>\n      <span class=\"green\">mental illness</span><br>\n      ;思想的; 精神<br>\n      的; 思考的; 智<br>\n      力的\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <span class=\"term\">program</span>:&nbsp; n.<br>\n      计算机】程<br>\n      序;<br>\n      v.计划; 规<br>\n      划; 安排\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry small-gap\">\n      <span class=\"term\">entire</span>: adj.<br>\n      全部的; 整个<br>\n      的<br>\n      <span class=\"green\">同义词:</span><br>\n      <span class=\"blue\">whole</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry small-gap\">\n      <span class=\"pink\">为了...(目</span><br>\n      <span class=\"pink\">的)</span><br>\n      <span class=\"pink\">短语:</span><br>\n      <span class=\"pink\">in order to</span><br><br>\n      <span class=\"pink\">so as to</span><br><br>\n      <span class=\"pink\">so that</span>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
